    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels more than just overwhelming though. it's like i've been phased out. like a book that's been read and put away in a dusty corner while everyone else is reading something new. it's not even that i'm struggling to keep up, it's just that there's nothing left for me to participate in. it feels like my time is just... done.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
